<blockquote>
<p>As I sat on the chair I pondered sadly, but not desperately,<br />
Why the core of the world exuded such black light.<br />
<a href="https://internetpoem.com/jean-arp/the-plain-poem/">--Hans Arp</a></p>
</blockquote>
<p>First, a disclaimer:</p>
<h2><span>THIS IS BEST EXPERIENCED ON A DESKTOP AND AN UPDATED BROWSER</span></h2>
<p><strong>There are a lot of moving parts here and we are only two people. There is a good chance that there will be bugs or weird elements, especially for those on older browsers and mobile. I've done my absolute best to make sure everything works for all readers. If you come across an issue, please do report it, but I do not guarantee that it will be fixed.</strong></p>
<p>This has been a long time coming. Kaktus and I started writing and planning this for the GoI Collabcon. Luckily, we finished exactly on time&#8230;</p>
<p>The two GoIs merging here are the Church of the Broken God and Are We Cool Yet?, which is probably pretty obvious once you read it.</p>
<p>I really hope everyone enjoys it. The amount of work we've put into this is&#8230; honestly, kind of staggering.</p>
<p>I'm both nervous and excited to hear what you guys think.</p>
<p>Thanks for reading!</p>
