<h2><span>Just a few Technical FAQ!</span></h2>
<p><strong>Q.</strong> Why can I just skip the whole survey and not put anything in?<br />
<strong>A.</strong> While I wanted verisimilitude to be really strong in this, I also did not want to needlessly irritate those that may be re-reading the SCP or accidentally refresh. As such, you are not required to fill in any of the entries unless you want to. The Foundation may be keeping track, though ;]</p>
<p><strong>Q.</strong> On offset/3 or offset/4, why does the &quot;Submit for Approval&quot; always give me an X?<br />
<strong>A.</strong> These are not the intended way to get to the next &quot;chapter,&quot; so to speak. I did not give people the ability to move to the next part that way as you would miss out on parts of the SCP if you did so.</p>
<p><em>For offset/3,</em> you need to get to the end of the Survey, press &quot;Submit,&quot; and wait for the link that brings you to the next part.</p>
<p><em>For offset/4,</em> you need to click the right arrow until you get to the final page. It will appear to glitch and the final link will, again, appear for you to click.</p>
<p><strong>Q.</strong> [Insert technical issue here]], can you fix it?<br />
<strong>A.</strong> I'd love to! Just make sure to give me some information so I can do so. I need <strong>Device you are browsing on (e.g. Samsung Galaxy S5/iPhone 8/Windows PC/etc.), as well as the Browser and Version you are using (e.g. Firefox 68.0.2/Chrome 76.0.3809.132/etc.).</strong> For mobile devices, the phone version and the browser you are using should be enough.</p>
<p>Thanks guys! I hope I can get this to be a good experience for everyone. :]</p>

